      "timestamp": "2026-04-22T01:48:46+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We are witnessing the first time in history that someone has said \"I'm not going unless JD Vance is there.\"\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2046650404901916803",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-21T18:00:56+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Senior White House officials say Trump wants to seem unstable in his social media posts.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2046567821111390284",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-21T12:32:46+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "What is Trump's best case scenario in Iran?\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2045954235246751851",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-19T19:54:36+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Trump's supporters in the media share their thoughts on the president posting an image of himself as Jesus, the war in Iran, and DoorDash Grandma's delivery to the White House.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2045922128155812026",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-19T17:47:01+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Trump calls the DoorDash Grandma bit \u201ctacky.\u201d\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2045880342322540736",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-19T15:00:58+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\"Remember the crusades? That was bad.\"\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2045513832496234508",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-18T14:44:36+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "If Trump issues pardons, Democrats will have to get creative in how they hold his people accountable.\n\nVideo",
